          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "# 🌐 Multi-Server MCP Monitoring\n\n## Shared Monitoring Stack Architecture\n\n```\n┌─────────────────┐    ┌─────────────────┐    ┌─────────────────┐\n│ Ring MCP        │    │ HomeKit MCP     │    │ SmartThings MCP │\n│ Server          │    │ Server          │    │ Server          │\n│                 │    │                 │    │                 │\n│ • ring-mcp      │    │ • homekit-mcp   │    │ • smartthings   │\n│ • Ring devices  │    │ • Apple devices │    │ • Samsung dev   │\n│ • Cameras       │    │ • Lights        │    │ • Sensors       │\n└─────────────────┘    └─────────────────┘    └─────────────────┘\n         │                       │                       │\n         └───────────────────────┼───────────────────────┘\n                                 │\n                    ┌─────────────────┐\n                    │ Shared Stack    │\n                    │                 │\n                    │ • Loki          │\n                    │ • Prometheus    │\n                    │ • Grafana       │\n                    │ • Promtail      │\n                    └─────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Benefits:\n- **Centralized logging** for all home automation\n- **Unified dashboards** across all services\n- **Correlated events** between different systems\n- **Shared alerting** and notification rules\n- **Cost effective** single monitoring stack\n\n## Server Labels:\n- `service=ring-mcp-server` - Ring security devices\n- `service=homekit-server` - Apple HomeKit devices\n- `service=smartthings-server` - Samsung SmartThings\n- `log_type=application` - Application logs\n- `device_type=camera|sensor|light` - Device categories\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.2.0",
      "title": "Multi-Server Architecture",
      "type": "text"
    },
