        "content": "# 📊 Multi-Server Health Status\n\n## Server Status Overview:\n\n| Server | Status | Last Log | Services | Health |\n|--------|--------|----------|----------|--------|\n| **Ring MCP** | 🟢 Online | 2 min ago | Cameras, Security | ✅ Good |\n| **HomeKit** | 🟢 Online | 1 min ago | Lights, Sensors | ✅ Good |\n| **SmartThings** | 🟡 Warning | 5 min ago | Devices, Hub | ⚠️ Check |\n\n## Recent Cross-Service Events:\n\n### 🔄 **Correlated Events**\n- **10:30 AM**: Ring camera detected motion → HomeKit lights activated\n- **10:25 AM**: SmartThings sensor triggered → Ring cameras started recording\n- **10:20 AM**: HomeKit door lock engaged → Security system armed\n\n### 🚨 **Active Alerts**\n- SmartThings hub connectivity intermittent\n- HomeKit device sync in progress\n- Ring camera battery check needed\n\n### 📈 **System Performance**\n- **Total Events**: 1,247 today\n- **Error Rate**: 0.3% (excellent)\n- **Response Time**: < 500ms average\n- **Data Retention**: 30 days\n\n## Configuration:\n\n### Loki Labels for Multi-Server:\n```yaml\nscrape_configs:\n  - job_name: multi-mcp-logs\n    static_configs:\n      - targets:\n          - localhost\n        labels:\n          service: \"{{inventory_hostname}}\"  # Server name\n          log_type: application\n          environment: production\n          team: home-automation\n```\n\n### Prometheus for Multi-Server:\n```yaml\nscrape_configs:\n  - job_name: 'mcp-servers'\n    static_configs:\n      - targets: ['ring-mcp:8123', 'homekit:8124', 'smartthings:8125']\n    labels:\n      service: mcp-server\n      instance: '{{ $labels.instance }}'\n```\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.2.0",
      "title": "Multi-Server Health Status",
      "type": "text"
